@startuml

left to right direction

' ===== GENERAL STYLE =====

skinparam backgroundColor #F7F8FA
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #1F2937
skinparam ArrowThickness 2


' ===== DATABASE RESPONSIBILITY =====

rectangle DatabaseRole #DCEEFF [
<b>DATABASE</b>
<i>Marjorie</i>

Database design
Tables & relations
Data types
Constraints
]


' ===== PRISMA SCHEMA =====

rectangle PrismaSchema #FFF0D6 [
<b>PRISMA SCHEMA</b>
<i>schema.prisma</i>

Models
Fields & types
Primary keys
Foreign keys
Relations
Constraints
]


' ===== PRISMA MIGRATE =====

rectangle PrismaMigrate #DDF5E5 [
<b>PRISMA MIGRATE</b>

Creates migrations
Generates SQL
Applies database changes
]


' ===== POSTGRESQL =====

rectangle PostgreSQL #D8F3DC [
<b>POSTGRESQL</b>
<i>Database</i>

Tables
Columns
Relations
Stored data
]


' ===== BACKEND RESPONSIBILITY =====

rectangle BackendRole #E8DFFF [
<b>BACKEND</b>
<i>Mathieu</i>

NestJS
API
Business logic
Authentication
Validation
]


' ===== PRISMA CLIENT =====

rectangle PrismaClient #FFE0E5 [
<b>PRISMA CLIENT</b>

Read data
Create data
Update data
Delete data
]


' ===== SCHEMA / MIGRATION FLOW =====

DatabaseRole -[#3B9ED8,thickness=3]-> PrismaSchema : Defines

PrismaSchema -[#F2A65A,thickness=3]-> PrismaMigrate : Schema changes

PrismaMigrate -[#55B981,thickness=3]-> PostgreSQL : SQL migrations


' ===== BACKEND / DATA FLOW =====

BackendRole -[#8B6BD9,thickness=3]-> PrismaClient : Uses

PrismaClient -[#E86A92,thickness=3]-> PostgreSQL : Queries


' ===== PRISMA CLIENT GENERATION =====

PrismaSchema -[#F2A65A,thickness=2,dashed]-> PrismaClient : Generates types

@enduml